Fix libdir settings.

In some configurations, including the Geant4 configuration can (via an
indirectly-include Qt6 configuration) set CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR to lib64.
This results in some libraries being installed in lib and some in lib64.
Setup scripts such as thisdd4hep.sh, on the other hand, expect libraries
to be only in lib.  This can then result in test failures due to failures
to find plugins.

Work around by Explicitly seting CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR to lib
(if it hasn't already been set).

Fixes CI failure in key4hep job.
